flowchart LR
  Image[Validated image] --> HSV[Resize RGB to circular HSV]
  HSV --> K[K-Means]
  K --> Palette[Weighted palette]
  Kit[Owner kit] --> Match[Distance matching]
  Palette --> Match
  Match --> Coverage[Color coverage score]
  Caption[Caption] --> Clean[Remove URLs and hashtags]
  Clean --> Model{Trained artifact?}
  Model -- Yes --> Distil[DistilBERT multilabel ranking]
  Model -- No --> Keywords[Explicit keyword-only assistance]
  Distil --> Rules[Sourced rule filtering]
  Keywords --> Rules
  CSV[Account-specific CSV] --> Sort[Daily means and chronological split]
  Sort --> Fit[ARIMA / Prophet]
  Fit --> Evaluate[Held-out MAE and RMSE]
  Fit --> Future[Refit future forecast with intervals]
